    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Game Information</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Feather Of Praying&quot; is a horror puzzle RPG released in 2016, which has received numerous positive reviews since its launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was officially launched on Steam in 2018 and underwent a major update in 2024,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">adding new endings while also bringing new puzzle content and performance experiences.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/b2cf028b6b8e0d780bb78ce7c7e3a596.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cI'll tell you another story.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cThis is a story about a girl and a wish.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cA warm and romantic fairy tale\u2026\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/33dce2295199caa71a28b01c9a22499a.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a story about &quot;wishes&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interwoven with feelings of sadness and healing, where terrifying scenes blend with dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cLet me fulfill your wish for you, but the corresponding price is\u2026\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, players will take on the role of a girl named Qiu Xiaoqi, waking up in a strange room. She will explore the mysterious room filled with puzzles alongside a mysterious young man with white hair, unraveling layers of mechanisms and uncovering the truth behind her loss of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/7f1d5eafd03c46d218ad54b1ad7e77a1.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this journey full of choices and unknowns,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">players will face various challenges as they explore in a terrifying environment,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">experiencing the profound emotional journeys of the characters through memories and dreams, exploring the wishes hidden deep within their hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Will this wish be fulfilled? How will this story unfold? Everything is for you to write\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/1a65d0754c85879bbf801dcc4754c6f1.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/d17aad6310643dc7cb0ace1b3a66f2b2.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive horror atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every unknown fear draws you deeply into it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intricate puzzle design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creative mechanisms provide a unique exploration experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heart-pounding storyline</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The profound emotional journeys of the characters present a moving tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich sound performance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful music and intense sound effects perfectly blend into the game atmosphere.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/ffa90d73c84144d3991c36b6b2a95666.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Type:</strong> Horror Puzzle<br><strong>Number of Endings:</strong> 7 (*updated in 2024)<br><strong>Estimated Playtime: 2</strong>-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basic Controls:</strong><br>Movement: Arrow keys<br>Investigate/Confirm: Z/Space/Enter<br>Menu/Cancel: X/ESC<br>Save Management: F5<br>Resolution Adjustment: F6<br>Run: Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/2416b866d40f43f05ced4fd1bc287739.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Author: \u79cb\u4e4b\u5fe7\u90c1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Artist: \u96e8\u516e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Publisher: Eternal Dream Studio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For more staff, please see the in-game credits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/ac7c0b8b26b0034ae50b47fbe2d8a330.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the first horror puzzle game I developed in 2016.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It was my first time making a horror puzzle game, so I hope everyone understands if there are any shortcomings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game does not contain any jump-scare CG flashes, so there\u2019s no need to worry about being startled by CG suddenly~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game has undergone multiple tests, but if there are any remaining bugs, please report them immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feedback channel: <a href=\"mailto:413228337@qq.com\">413228337@qq.com</a></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/b2cf028b6b8e0d780bb78ce7c7e3a596.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cI'll tell you another story.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cThis is a story about a girl and a wish.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cA warm and romantic fairy tale\u2026\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/33dce2295199caa71a28b01c9a22499a.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a story about &quot;wishes&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interwoven with feelings of sadness and healing, where terrifying scenes blend with dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cLet me fulfill your wish for you, but the corresponding price is\u2026\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, players will take on the role of a girl named Qiu Xiaoqi, waking up in a strange room. She will explore the mysterious room filled with puzzles alongside a mysterious young man with white hair, unraveling layers of mechanisms and uncovering the truth behind her loss of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/7f1d5eafd03c46d218ad54b1ad7e77a1.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this journey full of choices and unknowns,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">players will face various challenges as they explore in a terrifying environment,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">experiencing the profound emotional journeys of the characters through memories and dreams, exploring the wishes hidden deep within their hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Will this wish be fulfilled? How will this story unfold? Everything is for you to write\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/1a65d0754c85879bbf801dcc4754c6f1.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/d17aad6310643dc7cb0ace1b3a66f2b2.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive horror atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every unknown fear draws you deeply into it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intricate puzzle design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creative mechanisms provide a unique exploration experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heart-pounding storyline</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The profound emotional journeys of the characters present a moving tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich sound performance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful music and intense sound effects perfectly blend into the game atmosphere.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/ffa90d73c84144d3991c36b6b2a95666.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Type:</strong> Horror Puzzle<br><strong>Number of Endings:</strong> 7 (*updated in 2024)<br><strong>Estimated Playtime: 2</strong>-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basic Controls:</strong><br>Movement: Arrow keys<br>Investigate/Confirm: Z/Space/Enter<br>Menu/Cancel: X/ESC<br>Save Management: F5<br>Resolution Adjustment: F6<br>Run: Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/2416b866d40f43f05ced4fd1bc287739.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Author: \u79cb\u4e4b\u5fe7\u90c1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Artist: \u96e8\u516e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Publisher: Eternal Dream Studio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For more staff, please see the in-game credits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869840/extras/ac7c0b8b26b0034ae50b47fbe2d8a330.avif?t=1728371084\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the first horror puzzle game I developed in 2016.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It was my first time making a horror puzzle game, so I hope everyone understands if there are any shortcomings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game does not contain any jump-scare CG flashes, so there\u2019s no need to worry about being startled by CG suddenly~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game has undergone multiple tests, but if there are any remaining bugs, please report them immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feedback channel: <a href=\"mailto:413228337@qq.com\">413228337@qq.com</a></p>",
